{"schema_version":1,"guid":"https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/55c8-audiofreehighqps/48/73/CKwRIDoD9Yo8ABAAAACFLKlU.mp3","apple_collection_id":"1554650206","show":"科学育儿｜父母高质量育儿法","titel":"别再把孩子裹成粽子","audio":{"url":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//CKwRIDoD9Yo8ABAAAACFLKlU.mp3.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=26505641&track_id=387503183&uid=20961882&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/55c8-audiofreehighqps/48/73/CKwRIDoD9Yo8ABAAAACFLKlU.mp3","user_agent":"PodcastsAM/1.0 (+https://amapps.app)","groesse":6110603,"format":"mp3","geprueft_am":"2026-08-22T23:16:20+00:00"},"faehigkeiten":{"clips":true,"range":true,"kapitel":true,"dynamik":"unbestimmt","grund":"Dynamik weder belegt noch ausgeschlossen: keine Merkmale gefunden, aber eine unveraenderte Wiederholungsprobe beweist nichts"},"einzeiler":"探讨如何科学给孩子穿衣，避免过度保暖。","kurzfassung":"传统观念认为应该给孩子多穿衣服以防感冒，但实际上婴幼儿体内的棕色脂肪含量很高，让他们处于温室环境中反而不利于脂肪发挥作用。孩子其实是怕热不怕冷的生物，家长可以通过触摸后颈窝来判断穿衣是否合适。科学的做法是比大人少穿一件，让身体适应较低的温度。","stichpunkte":["传统观念主张给孩子多穿衣服来避免生病","人体内的白色脂肪导致肥胖，而棕色脂肪负责在寒冷时燃烧白色脂肪产生热量","婴儿体内的棕色脂肪含量比成人高出很多","随着年龄增长棕色脂肪逐渐减少，导致成年人更怕冷","现代温室般的空调环境使体内的棕色脂肪难以被调动发挥作用","专家建议关闭部分制热系统，让身体处于稍凉爽的环境中","婴幼儿其实是怕热不怕冷的生物，标准是比大人少穿一件","通过摸孩子后颈窝判断冷热：温热干爽为合适，发凉为穿少，湿润出汗为穿多"],"kapitel":[{"titel":"探讨给孩子穿衣的传统观念与人体脂肪","start":0.0},{"titel":"棕色脂肪的作用与现代生活环境的影响","start":29.5},{"titel":"科学给孩子穿衣的标准与判断方法","start":106.84}],"clips":[{"hook":"传统观念要给孩子多穿衣？","start":6.984,"ende":27.072,"laenge":20.09,"byte_start":280523,"byte_ende":1084042,"bytes":803520,"range_header":"bytes=280523-1084042","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":7.056,"anker_sha256":"5a614dc241cbc6d2975b5b7c341ab3dfcfeb25d6c10b75244aa2082f145ad71a","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"老一辈总主张给幼儿多加衣物以防着凉，育儿专家首先指出需要认识人体内的特殊脂肪。","anker_ende_sha256":"90a8a96dbd29f36c70e1498e10f029dd6873ae836d1dca29213111b883d79f2d"},{"hook":"为什么越长大越怕冷？","start":44.64,"ende":64.728,"laenge":20.09,"byte_start":1786763,"byte_ende":2590282,"bytes":803520,"range_header":"bytes=1786763-2590282","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":44.712,"anker_sha256":"ebe3c4f004ff2b93ec12c5e0b9cbd2c1007d7fb1bf7ffc890af1d4b85c60d76f","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"婴幼儿体内的褐色脂肪比例远超成人，这种成分会随年龄增长而减少，这也是成年人抗寒能力下降的原因。","anker_ende_sha256":"809c31b078492286ccdd3730df397e32db7208580843c187781dae127e451c6f"},{"hook":"温室环境让身体失去抗冻能力","start":67.536,"ende":87.624,"laenge":20.09,"byte_start":2702603,"byte_ende":3506122,"bytes":803520,"range_header":"bytes=2702603-3506122","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":67.608,"anker_sha256":"21f278a1047e076463ec3c8abe19b9e3925b57f5a3a69d4fb64ab23995e46171","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"过去几十年的生活环境相对寒冷，而现代人长期处于办公室、商场和私家车等温室般的暖环境中，这种生活方式存在特定弊端。","anker_ende_sha256":"c510fafa5100c030d8527cb7a736e8b0a4e976709f32c872cfc930a7a36b5ae0"},{"hook":"孩子其实是怕热不怕冷的生物","start":111.768,"ende":131.88,"laenge":20.11,"byte_start":4471883,"byte_ende":5276362,"bytes":804480,"range_header":"bytes=4471883-5276362","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":111.84,"anker_sha256":"8d83eef007a97c0a701a0ba7e682e5f87faaf705fd69dfde927ca14b3341bb89","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"由于幼童体内含有大量能产生热量的褐色脂肪，他们对炎热的耐受力远低于寒冷，主张应当比大人少穿一件衣物。","anker_ende_sha256":"aefb961173b1a015e15c7163af864f4270d5db22e6854066754ca37b5349a089"},{"hook":"如何判断孩子衣服穿得合不合适？","start":123.864,"ende":143.976,"laenge":20.11,"byte_start":4955723,"byte_ende":5760202,"bytes":804480,"range_header":"bytes=4955723-5760202","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":123.936,"anker_sha256":"a65afa4f9ed3d31a4e54701ed43042f79281fbdfbde2a0809dc8458096a26db4","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"判断穿衣是否合适时，只需触摸婴幼儿的颈后部位；只要该区域保持温热且干爽即为正常，微凉则代表衣物不足。","anker_ende_sha256":"2fe554083363e50b64e53a21e413630ebc0ed759cd125730a69c531ebc9d78ee"}],"erzeugt":{"am":"2026-08-22T23:16:20+00:00","transkript_modell":"faster-whisper large-v3","transkript_quelle":"whisper","verstehen_modell":"gemini-flash-lite-latest","prompt_version":2},"sprache":"zh","texte_sprache":"zh","texte_herkunft":"erzeugt","dauer":152,"veroeffentlicht":"2021-02-20T01:00:10+00:00","bild_url":"https://fdfs.xmcdn.com/storages/6cfd-audiofreehighqps/7A/F7/CMCoOSED7AlfAALBNACB